      {
        "id": 7753,
        "name": "Amazing Penguin",
        "summary": "The hunt is on in this exciting action-maze game! Join Pendrich, the Prince of the Penguins as he battles the enchanted armies of Borbon The Great.\n\nAttack with mighty kicks that blast the enemies across the screen. Clear the panels of each land to progress to the next level. It takes timing and strategy to win back the land from Borbon's invaders!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7h5t.jpg",
